<article class="acw-page" data-ac-page-section="public-for-clinics" data-ac-acw-screen="ACW03-01">
  <section class="acw-hero">
    <div>
      <p class="acw-kicker">For clinics</p>
      <h1>Run your practice. <span class="acw-accent">Publish when ready.</span></h1>
      <p class="acw-hero__lede">ActiveClinic gives enrolled teams a secure operations app and an optional public clinic website. Registration creates your organisation immediately. Publishing a website is a separate step you control.</p>
      <p class="ac-public-actions">
        <a class="ac-btn ac-btn--primary" href="/register-clinic">Register Your Clinic</a>
        <a class="ac-btn ac-btn--secondary" href="/features">See platform features</a>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="acw-hero__media">
      <%- include('../partials/ac-media', {
        src: '/activeclinic/assets/platform/home-hero.jpg',
        alt: '',
        decorative: true,
        className: 'acp-hero__image',
        objectFit: 'cover',
        objectPosition: 'center 40%',
        aspect: '16 / 10',
        width: 960,
        height: 600,
        loading: 'lazy',
      }) %>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="acw-section">
    <header class="acw-section-header">
      <h2>Three pillars of clinic operations</h2>
      <p>What enrolled organisations can use today, without exposing internal architecture.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="acw-pillars">
      <article class="acw-card">
        <h3>Patient care coordination</h3>
        <p>Register patients, manage appointments, and handle reception queues after staff sign-in.</p>
        <a href="/features">Explore features</a>
      </article>
      <article class="acw-card acw-pillar--featured">
        <h3>Workflow efficiency</h3>
        <p>Staff tools for the day’s work. Public pages never include charts, prescriptions, or billing records.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="acw-card">
        <h3>Public presence</h3>
        <p>Directory listing and a branded mini-website when you publish. Patients see only what you choose to share.</p>
        <a href="/clinic-website">Clinic websites</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="acw-section ac-public-privacy-note">
    <h2>Honest product boundaries</h2>
    <p>ActiveClinic does not provide medical records access on this website. Clinic registration creates the organisation immediately; a public website is unpublished until the clinic publishes it. ActiveClinic does not send SMS or WhatsApp confirmations unless explicitly enabled and integrated.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="acw-cta-band">
    <div class="acw-cta-band__inner">
      <h2>Start with registration</h2>
      <p class="ac-public-actions">
